  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A solid disc of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&nbsp;and mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;rolls down without slipping on an inclined plane making an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math> with the horizontal. The acceleration of the disc will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi></math> is _______.&nbsp; (Round off to the Nearest Integer)</p><p>(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo></math> acceleration due to gravity)</p><p>(<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo></math> angle as shown in figure)</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/19b63ced-6c0c-4120-97dc-0d7e6d90a868-image.png\" style=\"width: 192px; height: 170px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msup><mi>mR</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
